{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_116_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f53df6da102e11f731020260a054bb53298a91f4def9ae4d301f903f2656160e", "ja": "（未来が、オーディションに落ち続けている。本人の\n希望もあって、色々なジャンルに挑戦しているが……）", "zh": "（未来一直没能通过试镜。应她本人的希望，正在挑战各种不同的领域，但是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_116_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f5df3fdbb132dd8a721f137b1864e5a84244e6234def8eac73fdd14ecf565895", "ja": "（ここは得意な事に絞って集中させる手もあるが、\n「全部やりたい」は未来の希望だしな……）", "zh": "（也可以让她专注于自己擅长的事情，不过“什么都想做”是未来的愿望啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_116_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e5ecc8dcbd7bdd30894b77011026dc4f1aac56bd79e27154687a8fb12b138a5c", "ja": "（とはいえ、あまり落ち続けていると\nモチベーションが下がるだろうし……難しいな）", "zh": "（话虽如此，要是一直落选，动力也会下降吧……真难办啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_116_1003_025roc", "source_sha256": "208de9bda5ff45eafda79f2431d7e0902e3cf967da7dfe88c7b4858ab1c89bb0", "ja": "でもミライ。情報番組もバラエティも、\nそれからドラマも、最終選考まで残ったんですよね？", "zh": "不过未来，无论是资讯节目、综艺节目，还是电视剧，都通过了最终筛选，入选了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_116_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "5f1409dd00f46788c748f2f56f562f4ce1c7e8a5ae8eb204d54669ade42b2545", "ja": "うん。いいところまでいくんだけど、\n結局ダメで……。その時に、言われるんだよね。", "zh": "嗯。每次都差一点就成了，\n可最后还是不行……而且每次都会被问到那个呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_116_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "f428c49bdc65c2cc65957c860fc9a9bf52e1e5e9a8b7cc4b9d17f389a6ff899d", "ja": "「君の強みは？」\n「個性は？」", "zh": "“你的优势是什么？”\n“个性是什么？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_116_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "6d9787e600dc88d8ab12b134f6b579870a519abfb40e756a9f2daf52efc14821", "ja": "「何ができるの？」\n「どこが、何が特別なの？」……って。", "zh": "“你擅长什么？”\n“你哪里、有什么特别的地方吗？”……像这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_116_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "6985747eef83d9aa7c32a5185b8a95328df07ff8f9b5597b6088ba9ceb2bf60f", "ja": "うっ……。それは、なんというか、その……\n厳しいですね……。", "zh": "呜……这个嘛，该怎么说呢……\n有点难回答……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_116_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "d4165edb524503c2721a85a012680f0bd735341f721ef0e5e5a2506e031f31ee", "ja": "この前は、「何がしたいの？」って聞かれたから、\n「みんなを笑顔にしたいです！」って答えたんだけど。", "zh": "之前有人问我“你想做什么？”，\n我回答说：“我想让大家都露出笑容！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_116_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "d4d638c98d62dbe403e8128233bf52f76b1fc8e9bfd949277b79e65f4b79105d", "ja": "そしたら、\n「それなら君の劇場でできてるでしょ？」って……。", "zh": "然后对方却说：\n“那不是已经在你的剧场里实现了吗？”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_116_1010_025roc", "source_sha256": "9b66a7615626240c0e34dfd5edffb4a2a5fe9fc0af43aa66c7e2c01a926d305d", "ja": "ストロングスタイルですね……。ロコだったら、\nハートブレイクしていたかもしれません……。", "zh": "真是强硬的作风呢……。要是换作ROCO，我可能已经心碎了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_116_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "f50fbe0e1ed7f26fd0c57bc3a11f88552bb7d6219e7351c8e5a97bb2f0c6c5c0", "ja": "ありさちゃん、ロコちゃん。\n私、もっと変わってなくちゃダメなのかな……？", "zh": "亚利沙、ROCO。\n我是不是必须要更有个性才行呀……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_116_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "fd537c06e6dec4bd1a2c41e76b919031166673cfad282fa61fc0e5dace148475", "ja": "ええ！？　そんなコトないと思います！\nありさ、王道は大事だって思います！", "zh": "诶！？我觉得没那回事！\n我也觉得，经典路线很重要！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_116_1013_025roc", "source_sha256": "35130d9b88f84ae56c431a484773bb8b70c6d8e7915a810d41fd427b08b94f9c", "ja": "ロコもそう思います。\nそれに、ミライは今だって十分個性的ですよ！", "zh": "ROCO也这么觉得。\n而且，未来现在已经足够有个性了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_116_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "ed1a5d848c2435acc845d0e7d70075c145791a2e6c11e56ad3cf450ddb0e3f6b", "ja": "そっか……なら、どうしたらいいと思う？", "zh": "这样啊……那你觉得该怎么做才好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_116_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "20bafc19f172a9ab05035d7ca422eebcba8a1946a42362497f967f14375cc524", "ja": "どうしたらいいか……。\nむ、難しい問題ですね……。", "zh": "该怎么办才好呢……\n唔，这可真是个难题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_116_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "e6d7e314e34d2b0bbe6d15ec3bec56ad0305e344275f86b0b064414975d2c1f2", "ja": "ありさもロコちゃんも、基本的には、\n好きなことをしているだけだと思うので……。", "zh": "亚利沙和ROCO，基本上\n都只是在做自己喜欢的事情而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_116_1017_025roc", "source_sha256": "c3e129cc131e65b103b5252785ef4672cc632b09e47f952c325dc28630d98a8e", "ja": "それでいうと、ミライのフェイバリットは……。", "zh": "这么说来，未来最喜欢的是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_116_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "3526abb131a2e4e3528179f6d89562f1abb96fdb0989e4c184342c08b2f6a304", "ja": "ライブ……？", "zh": "演唱会……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_116_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "50c34c2fd1106e19345cee1f2fbf6e4092c4454449d031f52e6a8ca14e92ba8b", "ja": "ですよね！　未来ちゃんのライブは、\n見ているだけで元気が出ますし！", "zh": "就是嘛！未来的演出，光是看着就能让人打起精神来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_116_1020_025roc", "source_sha256": "90ba8715e9e0451e6a3900a4aa677dd418fdc7ceb6840f1062293c61dc048dd2", "ja": "つまり、ミライの魅力を伝えるには、\nライブを見てもらわないと難しいってことでしょうか？", "zh": "也就是说，要传达未来的魅力，不让大家看看演唱会就很难，对吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_116_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "ea9757a7f0fb1c510bb1006f3630c00edd9e83a7f22b600fe56bcef4f9ac7e29", "ja": "そんなぁ！\nオーディションだと難しいよぉ～！", "zh": "怎么会这样！\n光靠试镜很难展现出来呀～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_116_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "96023ed2d980fc886c7d0ffbfc206cd3fd99b5fbad5c1f65e33bd4a3c9185329", "ja": "そ、そうですね。\n歌番組のゲストとかじゃありませんし。", "zh": "是、是这样呢。\n毕竟也不是去歌唱节目的嘉宾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_116_1023_025roc", "source_sha256": "0eea8c8e3bb9b682ad6e339f1286a2af455fab0d0e0afffa971b52f79bdee012", "ja": "大丈夫ですよ、ミライ！　もうすぐ定期公演ですし、\n気持ちをチェンジしてがんばりましょう！", "zh": "没事的，未来！定期公演马上就要到了，\n转换一下心情，打起精神来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_116_1024_014mir", "source_sha256": "4c4cd3e64c33e373a73d6341a47fad138c6ce0a3b3f17205687030db1fb800d1", "ja": "うぅ……。\nわかってるんだけど……。", "zh": "呜呜……\n我也明白是这样啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_116_1025_014mir", "source_sha256": "61524b02ef53ed4f78c89a996574f8a0d6e3963cb6a30964e5faceac288a2bf8", "ja": "みんなは、どんどん前へ進んでいってるのに。\n私、いつまで経っても同じな気がするよ～……。", "zh": "明明大家都在不断向前迈进。\n我却感觉自己无论过多久都还是老样子～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_116_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_116_1026_025roc", "source_sha256": "81fd81be6e7763e4da673759cc12979f235b90fe5dadb8d35bd0ea9fc6b9e35c", "ja": "ミライ……。", "zh": "未来……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
